"""US county recorder data for the VoiceLogPro distribution hub.

3145 counties + county-equivalents across all 50 states + DC,
sourced from the standard US FIPS county reference (kjhealy/fips-codes
mirror of the Census county list) cross-referenced with each state's
recorder-office convention and typical first-page recording-fee ranges
(2024-2026 public fee schedules).

Each county page answers a unique local-intent query:
  "file a mechanics lien in [county], [state]"

HONESTY NOTE: recorder addresses, phone numbers, and exact fees change.
These pages state the office type and fee RANGE and direct the user to
verify current specifics with the office. No fabricated contact details.
"""

# Fields:
#   fips          — 5-digit FIPS code
#   county        — display name (e.g. "Harris County")
#   slug          — URL-safe slug
#   state         — full state name
#   state_abbr    — 2-letter
#   state_slug    — URL-safe state slug
#   office        — the recording office type (e.g. "County Clerk")
#   office_phrase — human phrase for prose ("the county clerk's office")
#   fee_low/fee_high — typical first-page recording fee range, USD
#   long_name     — "Harris County TX"

